e":20,"t":"Episode 20","a":"2003-04-03","l":20},{"s":27,"e":1,"t":"Episode 1","a":"2004-01-06","l":20},{"s":27,"e":2,"t":"Episode 2","a":"2004-01-08","l":20},{"s":27,"e":3,"t":"Episode 3","a":"2004-01-13","l":20},{"s":27,"e":4,"t":"Episode 4","a":"2004-01-15","l":20},{"s":27,"e":5,"t":"Episode 5","a":"2004-01-20","l":20},{"s":27,"e":6,"t":"Episode 6","a":"2004-01-22","l":20},{"s":27,"e":7,"t":"Episode 7","a":"2004-01-27","l":20},{"s":27,"e":8,"t":"Episode 8","a":"2004-01-29","l":20},{"s":27,"e":9,"t":"Episode 9","a":"2004-02-03","l":20},{"s":27,"e":10,"t":"Episode 10","a":"2004-02-05","l":20},{"s":27,"e":11,"t":"Episode 11","a":"2004-02-10","l":20},{"s":27,"e":12,"t":"Episode 12","a":"2004-02-12","l":20},{"s":27,"e":13,"t":"Episode 13","a":"2004-02-17","l":20},{"s":27,"e":14,"t":"Episode 14","a":"2004-02-19","l":20},{"s":27,"e":15,"t":"Episode 15","a":"2004-02-24","l":20},{"s":27,"e":16,"t":"Episode 16","a":"2004-02-26","l":20},{"s":27,"e":17,"t":"Episode 17","a":"2004-03-02","l":20},{"s":27,"e":18,"t":"Episode 18","a":"2004-03-04","l":20},{"s":27,"e":19,"t":"Episode 19","a":"2004-03-09","l":20},{"s":27,"e":20,"t":"Episode 20","a":"2004-03-11","l":20},{"s":28,"e":1,"t":"Year 7 Intro","a":"2005-01-10","l":20,"d":"The day before the new school year begins, the new first formers are shown round. Alex's remote controlled blimp causes chaos. Togger ends up being blamed for his younger brother's actions."},{"s":28,"e":2,"t":"Meet the Wannabes","a":"2005-01-12","l":20,"d":"Tanya's braided hair and ankle tattoo don't go unnoticed by the staff. Togger and his friends have to email a French school to tell them all about themselves."},{"s":28,"e":3,"t":"Underground Tuck Shop Scam","a":"2005-01-17","l":20,"d":"Tigger discvers the Wannabies' stash of sweets ready to be sold in the unofficial school tuck shop as he tries to get Alex's car back. Chloe works out what has happened and she ends up telling Mr. Malachay that Tigger has been bullying Alex."},{"s":28,"e":4,"t":"Your New Math Teacher, Mr. Fox","a":"2005-01-19","l":20,"d":"The pupils votes for the name of the new radio station. A healthy eating campaign gets underway at the school seeing the pupils swapping sweets for fruit."},{"s":28,"e":5,"t":"Football Trials","a":"2005-01-24","l":20,"d":"Baz has got other things on his mind as the school holds football trials. Mrs Bassinger agrees to allow Spencer to make a film instead of the school play being held this year."},{"s":28,"e":6,"t":"The Hill Radio","a":"2005-01-26","l":20,"d":"As Kathy and Maddie argue it ends up being accidentally broadcast over the school radio. Taylor becomes the first DJ after stepping in. Ed forgets that it is Alex's birthday."},{"s":28,"e":7,"t":"Abel's In!","a":"2005-01-31","l":20,"d":"Abel manages to get through to the Football Academy but Togger fails to. The school votes in favour of producing My Fair Lady much to Spencer's horror."},{"s":28,"e":8,"t":"Tanya's Radio Station","a":"2005-02-02","l":20,"d":"Tanya ends up being banned from the French Exchange after venting her feelings over the school radio."},{"s":28,"e":9,"t":"Year 7 Swimming Lesson","a":"2005-02-07","l":20,"d":"Alex and Alison manage to get out of swimming practice. Dawn takes control of the script for My Fair Lady. Annie starts uses a stolen credit card."},{"s":28,"e":10,"t":"Tanya's Kidnapped","a":"2005-02-09","l":20,"d":"Tanya's secret meeting with Jean ends up becoming a terrifying ordeal for her."},{"s":28,"e":11,"t":"Tanya Returns to Grange Hill","a":"2005-02-14","l":20,"d":"Internet access is banned at the school following Tanya's ordeal. Maddie attempts to make Karen see Taylor's unreliability."},{"s":28,"e":12,"t":"Alex is Struggling","a":"2005-02-16","l":20,"d":"Tanya believes that she has seen her attacker at the school. Alex has a swimming lesson. Annie's lies about her credit cards become more complicated."},{"s":28,"e":13,"t":"Alex is Bullied by Mooey","a":"2005-02-23","l":20,"d":"Jeremy's hopes are dashed after he's fired from the school production. Alex's ego is boosted by Alison and Ed after they persuade him to go on the adventure trip."},{"s":28,"e":14,"t":"Outdoor Trip (1)","a":"2005-02-25","l":20,"d":"Chloe spoils the hunting expedition and is forced to pay the price on the adventure trip. Baz's dispute with Max grows and it leads to an accident happening."},{"s":28,"e":15,"t":"Outdoor Trip (2)","a":"2005-02-28","l":20,"d":"Alex manages to put his foot in his mouth after Alison's secret ends up being revealed. Togger comes to Tanya's rescue after she suffers with a panic attack in a maze."},{"s":28,"e":16,"t":"Alex's Tries to Take His Life","a":"2005-03-02","l":20,"d":"Alex fills his bag with books and secures it to his back and heads off to the pool. It is down to Spencer to try and save him in time."},{"s":28,"e":17,"t":"Alex Returns to Grange Hill","a":"2005-03-14","l":20,"d":"After Alex returns to school he renews his friendships. Tanya contacts Lucy and attempts to arrange a meeting with her to find out about more about the person who attacked her."},{"s":28,"e":18,"t":"Lucy Argees to Meet Tanya","a":"2005-03-16","l":20,"d":"After Annie brings to school a large amount of money she manages to lose it. Tanya is finally able to get Lucy to agree to meet with her."},{"s":28,"e":19,"t":"Premiere of the Film","a":"2005-03-21","l":20,"d":"The school film has its premier and the unofficial \"No Malarky\" video ends up being shown. Some loose ends are tied up."},{"s":28,"e":20,"t":"Annie Steals","a":"2005-03-23","l":20,"d":"Abel decides to leave the Football Academy. Spencer asks Kathy out on a date. Annie's desperation sees her stealing a laptop from the school."},{"s":29,"e":1,"t":"Episode 1","a":"2005-11-07","l":20,"d":"The school gates open for the first day of a new school year. Togger and his friends suddenly find themselves interested in the opposite sex."},{"s":29,"e":2,"t":"Episode 2","a":"2005-11-08","l":20,"d":"Tanya isn't impressed by the PE kit. Martin falls out with Maddie."},{"s":29,"e":3,"t":"Episode 3","a":"2005-11-09","l":20,"d":"Alex and Alison's friendship hits problems. Holly is saved from having an accident by Baz."},{"s":29,"e":4,"t":"Episode 4","a":"2005-11-10","l":20,"d":"Togger finds himself in trouble. Tanya continues her campaign for an improved PE kit."},{"s":29,"e":5,"t":"Episode 5","a":"2005-11-11","l":20,"d":"Togger and his friends find their lives in danger on the day of the wedding."},{"s":29,"e":6,"t":"Episode 6","a":"2005-11-14","l":20,"d":"Tanya decides to stand for the school council."},{"s":29,"e":7,"t":"Episode 7","a":"2005-11-15","l":20,"d":"Preparations get under way for the school's first ever GP. When Togger tries to help Tanya get elected to the school council his plan goes wrong."},{"s":29,"e":8,"t":"Episode 8","a":"2005-11-16","l":20,"d":"More of life from Britain's most famous school."},{"s":29,"e":9,"t":"Episode 9","a":"2005-11-17","l":20,"d":"Togger comes to school with a black eye."},{"s":29,"e":10,"t":"Episode 10","a":"2005-11-18","l":20,"d":"Togger continues to find himself in trouble."},{"s":29,"e":11,"t":"Episode 11","a":"2005-11-21","l":20,"d":"Tanya is concerned how Emma will react when she finds out that she is now seeing Baz."},{"s":29,"e":12,"t":"Episode 12","a":"2005-11-22","l":20,"d":"Tanya and Togger continue in their quest to get the school's PE kit improved. Karen isn't impressed when she learns that Baz is seeing Tanya."},{"s":29,"e":13,"t":"Episode 13","a":"2005-11-23","l":20,"d":"Tanya thinks about how her relationship with Baz is going."},{"s":29,"e":14,"t":"Episode 14","a":"2005-11-24","l":20,"d":"Taylor clashes with Max. Ed and Alex find themselves falling out with Tigger."},{"s":29,"e":15,"t":"Episode 15","a":"2005-11-25","l":20,"d":"The first showing of Togger's film is broadcast. Tanya decides to cancel her date with Baz."},{"s":29,"e":16,"t":"Episode 16","a":"2005-11-28","l":20,"d":"Chloe and Andrea find themselves in trouble."},{"s":29,"e":17,"t":"Episode 17","a":"2005-11-29","l":20,"d":"Togger finds himself in trouble when he states a protest over the state of the toilets."},{"s":29,"e":18,"t":"Episode 18","a":"2005-11-30","l":20,"d":"Emma ends up returning. Alex makes some smoothies for the restaurant. Tanya is asked out by Jeremy. The P.E referendum takes place at the school. Baz ends up fighting with Donnie."},{"s":29,"e":19,"t":"Episode 19","a":"2005-12-01","l":20,"d":"Mooey has no intention of going home without the prize money where he wins the remote control car race or not."},{"s":29,"e":20,"t":"Episode 20","a":"2005-12-02","l":20,"d":"The school term comes to a close and Martin proves the wind turbine project to be a cheat. Mrs. Bassinger offers Taylor a job. Togger and Tanya grow closer."},{"s":30,"e":1,"t":"Episode 1","a":"2007-01-16","l":20,"d":"Kathy comes to school in the learner car and bumps into the gate. Taylor Mitchell, who is now an assistant caretaker, tells Kathy off. Togger is left with the job of taking his younger sister, Lucy, to school. Jenny Young, Karen and Tanya's half sister, is new to Grange Hill."},{"s":30,"e":2,"t":"Episode 2","a":"2007-01-18","l":20,"d":"Tigger makes fun of a guard dog outside the travellers site. The dog chases Tigger and Alex, run in front of Kathy's car and she does an emergency stop. The dog ends up in the playground, but a boy makes the dog go home, much to Emma's fascination. The boy, named Kyle, is placed in Emma's form. Holly decides to organise an 18th birthday party for Baz."},{"s":30,"e":3,"t":"Episode 3","a":"2007-01-23","l":20,"d":"Ed and Tigger agree to help Alex with his business if they agree to cut them in on the deal. Emma gets closer to Kyle. Chloe sends some love text messages to Max. Holly is jealous of Baz's friendship with Anna."},{"s":30,"e":4,"t":"Episode 4","a":"2007-01-25","l":20,"d":"Kyle ends up putting a gypsy curse on Chloe. Mooey tells Alex to sell smoothies on credit. Togger learns that Andy is leaving to go to a private school."},{"s":30,"e":5,"t":"Episode 5","a":"2007-01-30","l":20,"d":"After seeing Baz dancing with Anna, Togger ends up playing a rough game of football and Baz fails to get up after being knocked to the ground."},{"s":30,"e":6,"t":"Episode 6","a":"2007-02-01","l":20,"d":"Tanya spends the day walking with Togger as everyone is left reeling following Baz's death. Donnie thinks that Togger is to blame for Baz's death."},{"s":30,"e":7,"t":"Episode 7","a":"2007-02-06","l":20,"d":"Togger is forced to face his problems. Chloe decides that she can profit from Baz's death. Kathy takes her Driving Theory Test. It is revealed that Baz died because he had a problem with her heart."},{"s":30,"e":8,"t":"Episode 8","a":"2007-02-08","l":20,"d":"Kathy gets drunk on the day of Baz's funeral and shocks everybody by what she has to say. Alex decides to get rid of his business."},{"s":30,"e":9,"t":"Episode 9","a":"2007-02-13","l":20,"d":"Emma uses of a home pregnancy test kit. Ed and Tigger perform an impressive magic trick on the radio. Tanya is shocked at the hairdressers. Holly decides to go to Australia."},{"s":30,"e":10,"t":"Episode 10","a":"2007-02-15","l":20,"d":"The year seven pupils are bullied by Alex. Chloe discovers a way to get Max's attention. Tanya learns from Emma about her pregnancy. Emma and Tanya learn that the travellers have moved on."},{"s":30,"e":11,"t":"Episode 11","a":"2007-02-20","l":20,"d":"Kathy gets drunk as she celebrates her birthday. Tigger uses Lucy's guinea pig in a magic trick but manages to lose it in the process. Chloe's kiss from Max is not quite how she imagined it would be."},{"s":30,"e":12,"t":"Episode 12","a":"2007-02-22","l":20,"d":"Tigger and Ed still are unable to locate the missing guinea pig. A raffle prize is stolen by Alex for Mooey."},{"s":30,"e":13,"t":"Episode 13","a":"2007-02-27","l":20,"d":"Jenny manages to spoil Tigger and Ed's magic tricks. Alex relays the aggression from Max and Mooey onto Bryn. Tanya ends up informing Togger about Emma's pregnancy."},{"s":30,"e":14,"t":"Episode 14","a":"2007-03-01","l":20,"d":"Kathy manages to pass her driving test. News of Emma's pregnancy spreads. Tanya calls Emma's mother and Emma is not happy."},{"s":30,"e":15,"t":"Episode 15","a":"2007-03-06","l":20,"d":"Tigger, Ed, Alison and Sammy take part in some ghost hunting. Kathy ends up going out partying once again and ends up being unable to remember if she slept with Donnie or not."},{"s":30,"e":16,"t":"Episode 16","a":"2007-03-08","l":20,"d":"Chloe takes a strange picture of Max to get revenge against him. Kathy's mother learns about Donnie Max and Mooey want Alex to find a fridge-freezer for them."},{"s":30,"e":17,"t":"Episode 17","a":"2007-03-13","l":20,"d":"Alex and Bryn's acquisition of a fridge ends up contributing towards the schools football efforts. Max learns that it was Chloe who took the photograph of him. Plans are made by Tanya to celebrate her birthday."},{"s":30,"e":18,"t":"Episode 18","a":"2007-03-15","l":20,"d":"Alex's bullying is revealed which leads to a fight that unites Togger and Donnie. Emma pays a visit to an abortion clinic."},{"s":30,"e":19,"t":"Episode 19","a":"2007-03-20","l":20,"d":"Max ends up ruining Karen's chances of winning the dance competition and spikes Martin's drink. Togger has an overseas holiday job lined up which upsets Tanya. Tanya and Togger end up sharing their first ever kiss."},{"s":30,"e":20,"t":"Episode 20","a":"2007-03-22","l":20,"d":"Everybody prepares to go to the school prom. Togger is surprised by Donnie. Emma reveals that she didn't go ahead with the abortion."},{"s":31,"e":1,"t":"New Beginnings","a":"2008-04-14","l":20,"d":"A new term has begun, and Lucy decides to take her dog into school, and it's Togger who will feel the wrath of Mr McDonnell, newly appointed deputy head, if the dog runs riot around Grange Hill. Meanwhile, Tanya finds herself at the centre of attention of three Year 7 boys."},{"s":31,"e":2,"t":"Boarderman","a":"2008-04-21","l":20,"d":"When Mr McDonnell bans skateboards, Boarderman, Grange Hill's very own superhero, is born. however, not all the kids are happy about the new craze, and a plot gets underway to flush Boarderman out."},{"s":31,"e":3,"t":"Election Day","a":"2008-04-28","l":20,"d":"Lucy and Jenny come to blows as they act as campaigners for Togger and Tanya in the school head boy/girl election. Lucy, alarmed at the prospects of her brother becoming head boy, begins campaigning against Togger, and tries to frame Jenny."},{"s":31,"e":4,"t":"Double Cross Country","a":"2008-05-12","l":20,"d":"Chloe comes to school with a faked bad leg to try to get out of the cross country run, but Kathy has been watching the CCTV. The forgotten-my-kit ploy doesn't work either: she and Andrea have to wear a lost property mish-mash. When they decide to hide inside a shed, Cloe and Andrea endure on a series of mishaps that leaves them stranded, miles away from Grange Hill."},{"s":31,"e":5,"t":"Food Fight","a":"2008-05-19","l":20,"d":"The CLC is to be formally opened by footballer star – turned chef – Dwayne Miller, once a pupil at the school. Many of the Year 8's don't like the celebrity who has sold out to a Spanish team and advocates unpalatable food like kelp – they plan an egg-throwing demo. Chloe intends to video Dwayne losing his temper and sell it to the media."},{"s":31,"e":6,"t":"The Thing About Mates","a":"2008-06-02","l":20,"d":"Sammy Lee is the only one who remembered Alison's birthday. Alex determinedly bakes a cake for her, while Tigger makes a special video on his phone for her. however, when he catches Alison and Ed kissing, news of their relationship spreads around the school, leaving Alison and Ed friendless."},{"s":31,"e":7,"t":"Buddy Hell","a":"2008-06-09","l":20,"d":"A buddy scheme is launched as the Year 6's start to make use of the facilities. Alex is on a mission to build a shy girls confidence. However, the scheme is threatened by Chloe when she targets Bryn's little sister Megan, and turns everyone against Alex."},{"s":31,"e":8,"t":"You're Nicked","a":"2008-06-16","l":20,"d":"A performance artist is due to come to school. A pensioner, Frank Hooper, arrives with some enthusiasm to use the computer facilities of the CLC: Alison and Sammy are convinced he is the artiste and start drawing him. The true performer, Mr. McGuffin, makes himself known to Mr. McDonnell – he is dressed as a policeman and sets up a mystery for the Year 7's to solve, aided by Tigger and Ed."},{"s":31,"e":9,"t":"Extra Terrestri-Hill","a":"2008-06-23","l":20,"d":"Bryn is convinced the strange happenings at Grange Hill are the cause of aliens. his friends are amused by this – except a skeptical Rachel, and the unlikely pair unite to prove they are telling the truth, putting Grange Hill in the spotlight with the local press."},{"s":31,"e":10,"t":"Schmutts","a":"2008-06-30","l":20,"d":"When a pedigree dog show is announced, Lucy and Jenny decide they'll make an alternative competition to see who owns the most badly behaved mutt. Jake is dismayed to hear that Jenny doesn't love her dog, Rory, any more – she wants to return it to the dogs home. The official dog show (organised by Laxo's aunt) gets underway."},{"s":31,"e":11,"t":"Building Bridges","a":"2008-07-07","l":20,"d":"A team-building exercise is under way to demonstrate the power of teamwork. The teams of four have to follow a series of clues and build a bridge with the parts they find. The ineffectual Miss Bettany is shocked to realize she's messed up with the clues, and both red and yellow teams are racing for the same location."},{"s":31,"e":12,"t":"Veggin' Out","a":"2008-07-14","l":20,"d":"Tigger is infatuated with Kathy, and happily agrees to help with an after-school task of showing round the mayor. When Lucy finds her dad is working for the local petting farm, delivering animals to the abattoir, she turns vegetarian – Jenny is skeptical that she'll keep it up for long."},{"s":31,"e":13,"t":"The Competition","a":"2008-07-21","l":20,"d":"Jenny enters the inter-school music competition and the prize is a trip to Liverpool and money for instruments. She is surprised when Jake appears with his own violin. Bryn and Ducket's piece is a comedy act. Two year 6's, Megan and Serena fall out over trying to impress Tanya, the head girl."},{"s":31,"e":14,"t":"Gift Rapped","a":"2008-07-28","l":20,"d":"Togger is overheard talking on his mobile about \"Tanya being ready\" and Lucy believes he is going to propose to Tanya. The school trip to Liverpool seems an ideal opportunity for Tigger to see Crew 82's secret gig. However, they are banned from going and hide in the toilet but Chloe spots them in there and gets money out of them to keep quiet."},{"s":31,"e":15,"t":"Who Are You?","a":"2008-08-04","l":20,"d":"Twenty words to describe your family id the task set for Grange Hill. Year 10's, are auctioned off as slaves. Clooney and Gyngel put a bid in for smug Chloe and Andrea who never would believe anyone would dare try to enslave them. Gyngel gets Andrea to wear \"Spock\" ears and is slowly won over to the cause of Star Trek, while Chloe keeps Clooney's amorous advances firmly at bay."},{"s":31,"e":16,"t":"Grapple","a":"2008-08-11","l":20,"d":"While Alex and Ed seem set for a wrestling grapple over Sammy, Andrea's aptitude for spelling puts her in the team for the Inter School Spelling Grapple. Chloe is mean about it and tells Andrea to spell pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis if she's so clever. Andrea meets the spelling champion, Olive Olliver, who silently spells out \"Drop Dead Loser\" with her Alphabeti Spaghetti."},{"s":31,"e":17,"t":"Where's the Justice?","a":"2008-08-18","l":20,"d":"Theo and Laxo decide to be mute for the day but still play pranks on everyone. When Chloe makes fun of Serena's dyslexia, her mentor Alex decides that they'll hold a \"bullies court\".Chloe refuses to apologize despite the threat of expulsion."},{"s":31,"e":18,"t":"Virtual Reality","a":"2008-09-04","l":20,"d":"When Jake and the other Year 8's get embroiled in virtual reality historical computer simulations, Jenny falls out with Jake and makes a new friend of Patsy Clark. Patsy's home life, an anorexic sister in America, her father working in espionage, all seem a little unbelievable to Lucy."},{"s":31,"e":19,"t":"Zut Alors!","a":"2008-09-11","l":20,"d":"French student Cecile gives Tigger a new look, but a collision with a netball post gives him a weird nightmare where all his friends have colourful, and scary personae."},{"s":31,"e":20,"t":"Bang","a":"2008-09-15","l":20,"d":"On the last day of school, Togger reminisces with Abel and Tanya about the old days: they recall their treasure hunt in the sewer tunnel – nearby, the Year 7's overhear and decide to explore themselves. Togger's on the verge of quitting, so Tanya calls in his uncle – ex pupil Tucker Jenkins, to persuade him to stay for his final year."}]}